// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Fosved Office v2 — Design Department (Дизайн) — NATIVE v1.0
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Replaces Python proxy stub with native Metalogos design engine.
// 12 skills (5 Tier 1 + 5 Tier 2 + 2 Tier 3), 8 bot commands,
// 12 hard rules, lifecycle state machine, disclaimer enforcement,
// accessibility gates, design token discipline, learning loop.
// 0 CallLLMProxy calls, 0 Python dependencies.
//
// Architecture:
//   HandleDesign(query, chat_id)
//     → ParseDesignQuery(query)           ← NLP + command detection
//     → RouteDesignCommand(cmd, ...)       ← 8 bot commands + free-text dispatch
//       → cmd=/design        → CreateDesignArtifact
//       → cmd=/design-spec   → GenerateComponentSpec
//       → cmd=/design-system → ManageDesignSystem
//       → cmd=/design-show   → ShowDesignArtifact
//       → cmd=/design-artifacts → ListDesignArtifacts
//       → cmd=/design-research → ConductUserResearch
//       → cmd=/design-iterate → IterateDesignArtifact
//       → cmd=/design-approve → ApproveDesignArtifact
//       → free-text           → DesignPipeline
//     → DesignPipeline (for free-text queries):
//       → DetectArtifactType                ← wireframe/mockup/spec/etc.
//       → EnforceHardRules                 ← 12 gates, all native
//       → LoadSkillTiers                   ← Tier 1 always, Tier 2 by type, Tier 3 explicit
//       → RunPreApprovalGate               ← WCAG + user tasks + states + responsive
//       → ExecuteDesignGeneration          ← call_llm with full context
//       → ValidateAccessibility            ← WCAG AA minimum, AAA for critical
//       → RecordArtifactLifecycle          ← db_execute state transition
//       → WrapWithDisclaimer               ← mandatory bookends
//     → RecordAssistantMessage
//
// Depends on BUILTINS only (no Python, no CallLLMProxy):
//   call_llm, db_execute, kv_get, kv_set, json_encode, json_get, parse_json,
//   to_string, to_float, to_int, length, contains, lower, substring,
//   join, split, now, format_date, hash, AuditLog,
//   RecordAssistantMessage, BuildContext, SendTelegramMessage
//
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
